The pieces. front_of_shape: shapeB₃ at border 0 as fifteen plain facts · border_gives · extends_of_laid · front_members · idx_below · shape_forward: the book-keeping forward · free_forward: Free₃ 0 ⟹ Free₃ 1, as «{ hf with … }» · on_forward: by PinsStay.onAt · srow_none | srow_some | eval_is | dot_is | dotOm_is: what five
